The doors close.
The S-Bahn pulls out.
I sit by the window again.
This train runs above the streets.
I look outside.
I rarely travel with the S-Bahn.
I often only travel with the U-Bahn to work.
But the ride up here is very beautiful.
I see many houses from above.
The afternoon sun shines on the roofs.
After a few stops I see water.
That is the river.
The river is very wide here.
I look at my app.
I must get out soon.
The next station is my station.
I take my backpack.
Then I stand up and walk to the door.
